OL,3,GNEWSABody found in Colombia in search
OL,4,Afor missing Anton Green
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a British man missing in
OL,7,FColombia have been told a body has been
OL,8,Ffound in the search for him.
OL,10,FAnton Green from Manchester had been
OL,11,Fliving in the South American country
OL,12,Ffor two-and-a-half years, but stopped
OL,13,Fresponding to messages in August.
OL,15,FEarlier, his family in Whalley Range
OL,16,Fwere told that a body had been
OL,17,Fdiscovered, and that it was believed to
OL,18,Fbe the 43-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
