OL,3,GNEWSABody found in Colombia in search
OL,4,Afor missing Anton Green
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey told the BBC that the news - which
OL,7,Fcame just hours after they had renewed
OL,8,Ftheir appeal for help finding him - had
OL,9,Fdevastated them and that they were
OL,10,F"trying to come to terms with what's
OL,11,Fhappened".
